  "description": "The latest performance snapshot for the HomePage shows a total page load time of **500\u202fms**. Breaking it down, the DNS lookup completed in **45\u202fms**, the TCP handshake took **25\u202fms**, and the server responded in **80\u202fms**. A redirect, when present, added another **30\u202fms**. Once the network steps were finished, the browser downloaded the page assets in **150\u202fms**, and the actual content rendered in **350\u202fms**. The DOM became interactive after **200\u202fms**, marking the point at which users could begin interacting with the page.\n\nThese measurements have been logged under the **\u201cPage\u202fLoad\u201d** user\u2011timing category, with the label **\u201cHomePage\u201d**. The custom timing variable used is **\u201cloadTime\u201d**, and the recorded user timing value matches the overall page load duration at **500\u202fms**."
